# Regression for flaw-and-Add.md A-4: a decimal integer literal that exceeds
# the 64-bit range used to be silently clamped to LLONG_MAX by strtoll (ERANGE
# ignored).  After the fix it must be a syntax error ("integer literal out of
# range"), i.e. a non-zero exit.
module myon.stdio
a = 99999999999999999999999999
myon.print(a)
